<title>UK: UK clears Jarvis' purchase of Relayfast.</title>
<headline>UK clears Jarvis' purchase of Relayfast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jarvis Plc, the facilities and construction group, said on Wednesday the Office of Fair Trading had cleared it purchase of track firm Relayfast Ltd.</p>
<p>Jarvis intends to buy the 50 percent of the firm it does not already own for around five million stg.</p>
<p>The group said in a statement a decision on its proposed 50 million stg acquisition of track renewal firm Fastline Group Ltd was &quot;expected in due course&quot;.</p>
<p>In June, chief executive Paris Moayedi had told Reuters the two proposed acquisitions would bring a &quot;considerable enhancement&quot; to earnings next year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
